                                                <path d="M8 1v2M8 13v2M1 8h2M13 8h2M3.2 3.2l1.4 1.4M11.4 11.4l1.4 1.4M11.4 3.2l-1.4 1.4M4.6 11.4l-1.4 1.4"/>
